OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,FSpeaking after the signing of Jimenez
OL,7,Fearlier this week, Edwards was clearly
OL,8,Fstill planning for the new campaign.
OL,10,F"Hopefully they (the fans) believe
OL,11,Fmore in what we're trying to do, but
OL,12,Fthere's a lot more we've still got to
OL,13,Fdo and there'll be more to come," he
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,F"We know things need to improve, and
OL,17,Fwe're working really hard to try and
OL,18,Fdo that as quickly as possible. The
OL,19,Fchallenge from those above me is that
OL,20,Fwe need to get promoted again.
OL,26,@rD@AOUuD@aO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,344,370,250,120,000,100
PN,34305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,F"The signings we're making at the
OL,7,Fmoment will be ticking one box and
OL,8,Fthere's more to be done, but then the
OL,9,Fresults and how we start the season is
OL,10,Fwhat matters."
OL,12,FExecutive chairman of Wolverhampton
OL,13,FWanderers Nathan Shi said: "I would
OL,14,Flike to personally thank Rob and his
OL,15,Fstaff for everything they have given
OL,16,Fto Wolves during what has been a very
OL,17,Fdifficult period in the club's recent
OL,18,Fhistory.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@NO]uD@\OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,344,370,250,120,000,100
PN,34306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,F"Rob accepted the challenge of
OL,7,Freturning to Wolves at a time when the
OL,8,Fsituation was extremely challenging,
OL,9,Fand throughout his time here he has
OL,10,Fconducted himself with
OL,11,Fprofessionalism, integrity and
OL,12,Fcommitment.
OL,14,F"This has been an extremely difficult
OL,15,Fdecision. Following the end of the
OL,16,Fseason, we undertook a thorough review
OL,17,Fof every aspect of the football
OL,18,Foperation.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,344,370,250,120,000,100
PN,34307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,F"This process involved careful
OL,7,Fconsideration of many factors and
OL,8,Fextensive reflection on what we
OL,9,Fbelieve is required to help the club
OL,10,Fprogress over the coming years.
OL,12,F"Our decision was not about character,
OL,13,Fprofessionalism or dedication. It was
OL,14,Fabout determining what we believe
OL,15,Fgives Wolves the strongest opportunity
OL,16,Fto move forward from a sporting
OL,17,Fperspective.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,344,370,250,120,000,100
PN,34308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,F"While there were positive signs and
OL,7,Fareas of progress, we ultimately
OL,8,Fconcluded that a different football
OL,9,Fdirection would better align with the
OL,10,Fstyle, identity and level of
OL,11,Fcompetitiveness we want to establish
OL,12,Fat the club.
OL,14,F"It would have been easier to continue
OL,15,Fwith what was familiar. However,
OL,16,Fleadership is not about choosing the
OL,17,Feasiest path, but about making the
OL,18,Fdifficult decisions we believe are
OL,19,Fright for the future of the football
OL,20,Fclub which will put Wolves on the
OL,21,Fstrongest platform to move forward.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,344,370,250,120,000,100
PN,34309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F343A1787615691
OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,F"Our ambition is to build a football
OL,7,Fclub capable of achieving sustainable
OL,8,Fsuccess. That requires clarity of
OL,9,Fvision, alignment throughout the
OL,10,Ffootball operation and the courage to
OL,11,Fmake difficult decisions when we
OL,12,Fbelieve they are in the best interests
OL,13,Fof the club."
OL,15,FThe club would like to place on record
OL,16,Fits thanks to Rob and his departing
OL,17,Fstaff for their professionalism,
OL,18,Fcommitment and hard work throughout
OL,19,Ftheir time at Compton Park, and wish
OL,20,Fthem every success in the future.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@MO]
