OL,3,CWolves sack manager Rob Edwards after
OL,4,Cless than six months in charge
OL,6,FThe process of appointing a new head
OL,7,Fcoach is already underway, with the
OL,8,Fclub focused on identifying a leader
OL,9,Fwho can help deliver the next phase of
OL,10,FWolves' sporting development. Further
OL,11,Fupdates will be provided in due course.
OL,13,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,14,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,15,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,16,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,17,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,18,Fbelow...
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/10
